Returns the symmetric difference of `self` and `rhs` as a new `HashSet<T, S>`.

# Examples

```
use hashbrown::HashSet;

let a: HashSet<_> = vec![1, 2, 3].into_iter().collect();
let b: HashSet<_> = vec![3, 4, 5].into_iter().collect();

let set = &a ^ &b;

