But of course it is just an normal empty `ArrayVec`:

```rust
# use tinyvec::ArrayVec;
let mut data = ArrayVec::from_array_empty([1, 2, 3, 4]);
assert_eq!(&data[..], &[] as &[i32]);
data.push(42);
assert_eq!(&data[..], &[42]);
```

