This is useful for large applications to delay definitions of subcommands until they are
being invoked.

# Examples

```rust
# use clap_builder as clap;
# use clap::{Command, arg};
Command::new("myprog")
    .subcommand(Command::new("config")
        .about("Controls configuration features")
        .defer(|cmd| {
