Extracts a mutable slice containing the entire vector.

Equivalent to `&mut s[..]`.

# Examples

```
use heapless::Vec;
let mut buffer: Vec<u8, 5> = Vec::from_slice(&[1, 2, 3, 5, 8]).unwrap();
