---
Operator `>=`. Expands to `GrEq`.

```rust
# #[macro_use] extern crate typenum;
# use typenum::*;
# fn main() {
assert_type_eq!(op!(P6 >= P3 + P2), True);
# }
```

---
Operator `<`. Expands to `Le`.

