Return the username for this URL (typically the empty string)
as a percent-encoded ASCII string.

# Examples

```
use url::Url;
# use url::ParseError;

# fn run() -> Result<(), ParseError> {
let url = Url::parse("ftp://rms@example.com")?;
assert_eq!(url.username(), "rms");

