```

# Sector Size.

Return the number of sectors occupied by this track.

## Examples

```
use cdtoc::Toc;

let toc = Toc::from_cdtoc("4+96+2D2B+6256+B327+D84A").unwrap();
let track = toc.audio_track(1).unwrap();
