Returns slices containing all keys and values in the slot map in an
arbitrary order (but in the same order for both slices). The values
slice is mutable.

# Examples

```
# use slotmap::*;
let mut sm = DenseSlotMap::new();
sm.insert(40);
sm.insert(50);
